{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50736","headline":"江上旅伯呈池州杜员外 · 张祜","name":"江上旅伯呈池州杜员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"（按《全唐诗》卷五一一收此诗之前四句，缺其後半。\n题作《江上旅伯呈杜员外》，今全录之。\n）牛渚南来沙岸长，远吟佳句望池阳。\n野人未必非毛遂，太守还须是孟尝。\n江郡风流今絶世，杜陵才子旧爲郎。\n不妨酒夜因闲语，别指东山是醉乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50736.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50736","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}